            <lem wit="A">warn’t no</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">wasn’t any</rdg>
          </app>
good because the brass showed through the silver a little, and it wouldn’t pass

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr0300"/>
nohow

