            <rdg wit="A">
I

              <lb/>
I said

            </rdg>
          </app>
it was pretty bad money, but maybe the hair-ball would take it, because maybe it wouldn’t know the difference. Jim

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr0307"/>
smelt it

