          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1022"/>
see um

          <app from="pr1022" n="54.26 (182.21–22)" type="e" xml:id="la2649">
            <lem wit="A">see um</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">see ’em</rdg>
          </app>
go by

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1023"/>
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0640"/>
heah

          <ptr target="#la9280" type="alt" xml:id="te0640"/>
          <app from="pr1023" n="54.26 (182.22)" type="e" xml:id="la2650">
            <lem wit="A">heah</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">
here/

              <add>heah</add>
            </rdg>
          </app>
;

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1024"/>
watched um

          <app from="pr1024" n="54.27 (182.22)" type="e" xml:id="la2651">
            <lem wit="A">watched um</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">watched ’em</rdg>
          </app>
          <ptr target="#mt0010" type="alt" xml:id="wn0010"/>
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0641"/>
thoo

          <ptr target="#la9282" type="alt" xml:id="te0641"/>
de bushes.”

        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15348">
Some young birds come along, flying a yard or two at a time and

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1025"/>
lighting. Jim

          <app from="pr1025" n="54.29 (183.4–5)" type="e" xml:id="la2652">
            <lem wit="A">lighting. Jim</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">
lighting.—

              <lb/>
Jim

            </rdg>
          </app>
said it was a sign it was going to rain. He said it was a sign when young chickens flew that way, and so he reckoned it was the

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1026"/>
same way

          <app from="pr1026" n="54.31 (183.10)" type="e" xml:id="la2653">
            <lem wit="A">same way</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">same</rdg>
          </app>
when young birds done it.

          <anchor type="an" xml:id="ahm020"/>
I was

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0642"/>
going

          <ptr target="#la9284" type="alt" xml:id="te0642"/>
to catch

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1027"/>
some

          <app from="pr1027" n="54.31 (183.12)" type="e" xml:id="la2654">
            <lem wit="A">some</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">one</rdg>
          </app>
of them, but Jim wouldn’t let me. He said it was death

          <ptr target="#as0073" type="an" xml:id="sam020"/>
. He said his father laid mighty sick once, and some of them catched a bird, and his old granny said his father would die, and he

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0643"/>
did.

          <ptr target="#la9286" type="alt" xml:id="te0643"/>
        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15389">
And Jim said

          <anchor type="an" xml:id="ahm021"/>
you

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1028"/>
mustn’t

          <app from="pr1028" n="54.35 (183.21)" type="hc" xml:id="la2655">
            <lem wit="MS1a">mustn’t</lem>
            <rdg wit="A">musn’t</rdg>
          </app>
count the things you

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0644"/>
are

          <ptr target="#la9288" type="alt" xml:id="te0644"/>
going to cook for dinner, because that would bring bad luck

          <ptr target="#as0074" type="an" xml:id="sam021"/>
. The

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0645"/>
same

          <ptr target="#la9290" type="alt" xml:id="te0645"/>
if you

          <anchor type="an" xml:id="ahm022"/>
shook the

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1029"/>
table-cloth

          <app from="pr1029" n="54.37 (184.4–5)" type="e" xml:id="la2656">
            <lem wit="A">table-cloth</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">
table-

              <lb/>
cloth

            </rdg>
          </app>
after sundown

          <ptr target="#as0075" type="an" xml:id="sam022"/>
. And he

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1030"/>
said

          <app from="pr1030" n="54.37 (184.6)" type="e" xml:id="la2657">
            <lem wit="A">said</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">said that</rdg>
          </app>
          <anchor type="an" xml:id="ahm023"/>
if a man owned a

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1031"/>
bee hive

          <app from="pr1031" n="54.38 (184.7)" type="hc" xml:id="la2658">
            <lem wit="MS1a">bee hive</lem>
            <rdg wit="A">bee-hive</rdg>
          </app>
, and that man died,

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0646"/>
the

          <ptr target="#la9292" type="alt" xml:id="te0646"/>
bees must be told

          <ptr target="#as0076" type="an" xml:id="sam023"/>
about it before

          <pb n="55" xml:id="pb0055"/>
sun-up next morning, or else the bees would all weaken down and quit work and die. Jim said

          <anchor type="an" xml:id="ahm024"/>
bees wouldn’t sting

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1032"/>
idiots

          <ptr target="#as0077" type="an" xml:id="sam024"/>
; but I didn’t believe that, because I had tried them lots of times myself, and they wouldn’t sting me.

        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15460">
I

          <app from="pr1032" n="55.2–5 (184.15)" type="e" xml:id="la2659">
            <lem wit="A">idiots; . . . me. [¶] I</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">
idiots.

              <note place="inline" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="de2660">
no

                <hi rend="normal">¶</hi>
              </note>
I

            </rdg>
          </app>
had heard about some of

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0647"/>
these

          <ptr target="#la9294" type="alt" xml:id="te0647"/>
things before, but not all of

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1033"/>
them. Jim

          <app from="pr1033" n="55.5–6 (184.18)" type="hc" xml:id="la2661">
            <lem wit="MS1a A">them. Jim</lem>
            <rdg wit="Cent">[¶] Jim</rdg>
          </app>
knowed all kinds of signs. He said he knowed

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1034"/>
most

          <app from="pr1034" n="55.6 (184.20)" type="hc" xml:id="la2662">
            <lem wit="MS1a A">most</lem>
            <rdg wit="Cent">’most</rdg>
          </app>
everything. I said it looked to

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0648"/>
me

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1035"/>
like

          <ptr target="#la9296" type="alt" xml:id="te0648"/>
          <app from="pr1035" n="55.7 (184.22)" type="e" xml:id="la2663">
            <lem wit="A Cent">like</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">as if</rdg>
          </app>
all the signs was about bad luck, and so I asked him if there warn’t any good-luck signs. He

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1036"/>
says:

          <app from="pr1036" n="55.8 (185.4)" type="e" xml:id="la2664">
            <lem wit="A Cent">says:</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">said,</rdg>
          </app>
        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15513">
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0649"/>
“Mighty

          <ptr target="#la9298" type="alt" xml:id="te0649"/>
few—an’

          <hi rend="italic">dey</hi>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1037"/>
ain’

          <app from="pr1037" n="55.9 (185.5)" type="e" xml:id="la2665">
            <lem wit="A Cent">ain’</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">ain’t</rdg>
          </app>
no use to

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1038"/>
a body

          <app from="pr1038" n="55.9 (185.6)" type="e" xml:id="la2666">
            <lem wit="A Cent">a body</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">anybody</rdg>
          </app>
. What you want to know when good luck’s

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0650"/>
a-comin’

          <ptr target="#la9300" type="alt" xml:id="te0650"/>
for?

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1039"/>
Want

          <app from="pr1039" n="55.10 (185.9)" type="hc" xml:id="la2667">
            <lem wit="MS1a">Want</lem>
            <rdg wit="A Cent">want</rdg>
          </app>
to keep it off?”

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1040"/>
And

          <app from="pr1040" n="55.10 (185.10)" type="e" xml:id="la2668">
            <lem wit="A Cent">
              <note place="inline" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="de2669">
no

                <hi rend="normal">¶</hi>
              </note>
And

            </lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">[¶] And</rdg>
          </app>
he said:

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1041"/>
“Ef

          <app from="pr1041" n="55.11 (185.11)" type="e" xml:id="la2670">
            <lem wit="A Cent">
              <note place="inline" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="de2671">
no

                <hi rend="normal">¶</hi>
              </note>
“Ef

            </lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">[¶] “If</rdg>
          </app>
you’s

          <anchor type="an" xml:id="ahm025"/>
got hairy arms

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0651"/>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1042"/>
en

          <app from="pr1042" n="55.11 (185.12)" type="e" xml:id="la2672">
            <lem wit="A Cent">en</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">an’</rdg>
          </app>
          <ptr target="#la9302" type="alt" xml:id="te0651"/>
a hairy breas’, it’s a sign

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0652"/>
dat

          <ptr target="#la9304" type="alt" xml:id="te0652"/>
you’s

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1043"/>
agwyne

          <app from="pr1043" n="55.12 (185.13–14)" type="e" xml:id="la2673">
            <lem wit="A Cent">agwyne</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">
a-

              <lb/>
gwyne

            </rdg>
          </app>
to be rich

          <ptr target="#as0078" type="an" xml:id="sam025"/>
. Well, dey’s some use in a sign like dat,

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1044"/>
’kase

          <app from="pr1044" n="55.12 (185.16)" type="e" xml:id="la2674">
            <lem wit="A Cent">’kase</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">’case</rdg>
          </app>
it’s so fur ahead. You see,

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1045"/>
maybe

          <app from="pr1045" n="55.13 (185.17)" type="hc" xml:id="la2675">
            <lem wit="MS1a A">maybe</lem>
            <rdg wit="Cent">may be</rdg>
          </app>
you’s got to be po’ a long time fust,

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0653"/>
en

          <ptr target="#la9306" type="alt" xml:id="te0653"/>
so you might git discourage’

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0654"/>
en

          <ptr target="#la9308" type="alt" xml:id="te0654"/>
kill

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0655"/>
yo’sef

          <ptr target="#la9310" type="alt" xml:id="te0655"/>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1046"/>
’f

          <app from="pr1046" n="55.14 (185.21)" type="e" xml:id="la2676">
            <lem wit="A Cent">’f</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">if</rdg>
          </app>
you

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1047"/>
didn’

          <app from="pr1047" n="55.14 (185.21)" type="e" xml:id="la2677">
            <lem wit="Cent">didn’</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">didn’t</rdg>
            <rdg wit="A">did n’</rdg>
          </app>
know by de sign

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1048"/>
dat you

          <app from="pr1048" n="55.15 (186.1–2)" type="e" xml:id="la2678">
            <lem wit="A Cent">dat you</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">dat you’s</rdg>
          </app>
gwyne to be rich

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0656"/>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1049"/>
bymeby

          <app from="pr1049" n="55.15 (186.2–3)" type="e" xml:id="la2679">
            <lem wit="A Cent">bymeby</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">by en by</rdg>
          </app>
          <ptr target="#la9312" type="alt" xml:id="te0656"/>
.”

        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15670">“Have you got hairy arms and a hairy breast, Jim?”</p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15672">
“What’s de use to ax dat question?

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1050"/>
Don’

          <app from="pr1050" n="55.17 (186.8)" type="e" xml:id="la2680">
            <lem wit="C">Don’</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">Don’t</rdg>
            <rdg wit="A Cent">don’</rdg>
          </app>
you see I has?”

        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15684">
“Well,

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0657"/>
are

          <ptr target="#la9314" type="alt" xml:id="te0657"/>
you rich?”

        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15691">
“

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1051"/>
No;

          <app from="pr1051" n="55.19 (186.12)" type="hc" xml:id="la2681">
            <lem wit="MS1a Cent">No;</lem>
            <rdg wit="A">No,</rdg>
          </app>
but I ben rich

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1052"/>
wunst

          <app from="pr1052" n="55.19 (186.13)" type="e" xml:id="la2682">
            <lem wit="C">wunst</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">once</rdg>
            <rdg wit="A Cent">wunst,</rdg>
          </app>
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0658"/>
and

          <ptr target="#la9316" type="alt" xml:id="te0658"/>
gwyne to be rich

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1053"/>
agin.

          <app from="pr1053" n="55.19 (186.14)" type="e" xml:id="la2683">
            <lem wit="MS1a Cent">agin.</lem>
            <rdg wit="A">
agin

              <hi rend="subscript">⁁</hi>
            </rdg>
          </app>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1054"/>
Wunst

          <app from="pr1054" n="55.19 (186.14)" type="e" xml:id="la2684">
            <lem wit="A Cent">Wunst</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">Once</rdg>
          </app>
I had

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1055"/>
foteen

          <app from="pr1055" n="55.20 (186.14)" type="e" xml:id="la2685">
            <lem wit="A">foteen</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">fourteen</rdg>
            <rdg wit="Cent">fo’teen</rdg>
          </app>
dollars, but

          <anchor type="an" xml:id="ahm026"/>
I

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1056"/>
tuck

          <app from="pr1056" n="55.20 (186.15)" type="e" xml:id="la2686">
            <lem wit="A Cent">tuck</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">took</rdg>
          </app>
to

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1057"/>
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0659"/>
specalat’n’

          <ptr target="#la9318" type="alt" xml:id="te0659"/>
          <app from="pr1057" n="55.20 (186.15–16)" type="e" xml:id="la2687">
            <lem wit="A">specalat’n’</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a Cent">speculat’n’</rdg>
          </app>
,

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1058"/>
en

          <app from="pr1058" n="55.20 (186.16)" type="e" xml:id="la2688">
            <lem wit="A Cent">en</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">and</rdg>
          </app>
got busted out

          <ptr target="#as0079" type="an" xml:id="sam026"/>
.”

        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15772">“What did you speculate in, Jim?”</p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15774">“Well, fust I tackled stock.”</p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15776">“What kind of stock?”</p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15778">
“Why, live stock. Cattle, you know.

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0660"/>
I

          <ptr target="#la9320" type="alt" xml:id="te0660"/>
put ten dollars in a cow. But I

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1059"/>
ain’

          <app from="pr1059" n="55.25 (187.5)" type="e" xml:id="la2689">
            <lem wit="A Cent">ain’</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">ain’t</rdg>
          </app>
gwyne to resk no

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0661"/>
mo’

          <ptr target="#la9322" type="alt" xml:id="te0661"/>
money in stock. De cow up

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1060"/>
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0662"/>
’n’

          <ptr target="#la9324" type="alt" xml:id="te0662"/>
          <app from="pr1060" n="55.25 (187.7)" type="e" xml:id="la2690">
            <lem wit="A">’n’</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">en</rdg>
            <rdg wit="Cent">’n</rdg>
          </app>
died on my han’s.”

        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15809">“So you lost the ten dollars.”</p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15811">
“

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1061"/>
No,

          <app from="pr1061" n="55.28 (187.11)" type="hc" xml:id="la2691">
            <lem wit="MS1a A">No,</lem>
            <rdg wit="Cent">No;</rdg>
          </app>
I

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1062"/>
didn’

          <app from="pr1062" n="55.28 (187.11)" type="e" xml:id="la2692">
            <lem wit="A Cent">didn’</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">didn’t</rdg>
          </app>
lose it all. I

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1063"/>
on’y

          <app from="pr1063" n="55.28 (187.12)" type="e" xml:id="la2693">
            <lem wit="A Cent">on’y</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">only</rdg>
          </app>
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0663"/>
los’

          <ptr target="#la9326" type="alt" xml:id="te0663"/>
’bout nine of it. I

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1064"/>
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0664"/>
sole

          <ptr target="#la9328" type="alt" xml:id="te0664"/>
          <app from="pr1064" n="55.28 (187.13)" type="e" xml:id="la2694">
            <lem wit="A Cent">sole</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">sol’</rdg>
          </app>
de hide

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0665"/>
en

          <ptr target="#la9330" type="alt" xml:id="te0665"/>
taller for a

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1065"/>
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0666"/>
dollar

          <ptr target="#la9332" type="alt" xml:id="te0666"/>
          <app from="pr1065" n="55.29 (187.14)" type="e" xml:id="la2695">
            <lem wit="A Cent">dollar</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">
dollar/

              <add>dollah</add>
              <note place="inline" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="de2696">see Alterations</note>
            </rdg>
          </app>
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0667"/>
en

          <ptr target="#la9334" type="alt" xml:id="te0667"/>
ten cents.”

        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15874">“You had five dollars and ten cents left. Did you speculate any more?”</p>
        <figure rend="block" xml:id="y05601">
          <graphic url="y05601.jpg"/>
          <ab type="caption">
            <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1093"/>
            <hi rend="smallcaps">misto bradish’s nigger</hi>
            <app from="pr1093" n="56 caption" type="hc" xml:id="la2730">
              <lem wit="A">
                <hi rend="smallcaps">misto bradish’s nigger</hi>
.

              </lem>
              <rdg wit="MS1a">
                <note place="inline" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="de2731">not in</note>
              </rdg>
              <rdg wit="Cent">
                <hi rend="smallcaps">the president of the bank</hi>
.

              </rdg>
            </app>
.

          </ab>
        </figure>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e15894">
“Yes. You know dat

          <anchor type="an" xml:id="ahm027"/>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1066"/>
one-laigged

          <app from="pr1066" n="55.32 (187.20)" type="e" xml:id="la2697">
            <lem wit="A Cent">one-laigged</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">one-legged</rdg>
          </app>
nigger dat b’longs to

          <anchor type="te" xml:id="tn0025"/>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1067"/>
ole

          <app from="pr1067" n="✱55.32 (187.21)" type="hc" xml:id="la2698">
            <lem wit="MS1a Cent">ole</lem>
            <rdg wit="A">old</rdg>
          </app>
          <ptr target="#tb0025" type="te" xml:id="tv0025"/>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1068"/>
Misto

          <app from="pr1068" n="55.32 (187.21)" type="e" xml:id="la2699">
            <lem wit="A Cent">Misto</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">
              <note place="inline" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="de2700">not in</note>
            </rdg>
          </app>
Bradish

          <ptr target="#as0080" type="an" xml:id="sam027"/>
?

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1069"/>
Well

          <app from="pr1069" n="55.33 (187.21)" type="hc" xml:id="la2701">
            <lem wit="MS1a Cent">Well</lem>
            <rdg wit="A">well</rdg>
          </app>
, he sot up a bank,

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0668"/>
en

          <ptr target="#la9336" type="alt" xml:id="te0668"/>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1070"/>
say

          <app from="pr1070" n="55.33 (188.2)" type="e" xml:id="la2702">
            <lem wit="A Cent">say</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1a">said</rdg>
          </app>
anybody dat put in a

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg0669"/>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr1071"/>
dollar

          <app from="pr1071" n="55.33 (188.3)" type="e" xml:id="la2703">
