        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e36218">
“Yes, he is.

          <anchor type="an" xml:id="gs0097"/>
He

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2773"/>
ain’t

          <app from="pr2773" n="151.5 (474.12)" type="hc" xml:id="la4528">
