ever told me you was here; told me to come, and he’d show me a lot of

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2774"/>
water-moccasins. If

          <app from="pr2774" n="151.6 (474.16–17)" type="e" xml:id="la4529">
            <lem wit="A Cent">water-moccasins. If</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1b">
water-moccasins.—

              <lb/>
If

            </rdg>
          </app>
anything happens,

          <hi rend="italic">he</hi>
ain’t mixed up in it. He can say he never seen us together, and it’ll be the

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2775"/>
truth.”

          <ptr target="#as0163" type="an" xml:id="gs0098"/>
        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e36247">
I

          <app from="pr2775" n="151.8–9 (475.4–476.1)" type="e" xml:id="la4530">
