the

          <app from="pr2776" n="151.9 (476.2)" type="e" xml:id="la4531">
            <lem wit="A Cent">the</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1b">that</rdg>
          </app>
next day. I reckon I’ll cut it pretty short. I waked up about

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg1570"/>
dawn,

          <ptr target="#l11140" type="alt" xml:id="te1570"/>
and was

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2777"/>
agoing

