            <lem wit="A">agoing</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1b">going</rdg>
            <rdg wit="Cent">a-going</rdg>
          </app>
to turn over and go to sleep again, when I noticed how still it was—didn’t seem to be anybody stirring. That warn’t usual. Next I noticed that Buck was up and gone. Well, I gets up,

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg1571"/>
a-wondering,

          <ptr target="#l11142" type="alt" xml:id="te1571"/>
and goes

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2778"/>
down stairs

