            <rdg wit="Cent">downstairs</rdg>
          </app>
—nobody around; everything

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2779"/>
as still

          <app from="pr2779" n="151.14 (477.7)" type="e" xml:id="la4534">
            <lem wit="A Cent">as still</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1b">still</rdg>
          </app>
as a mouse. Just the same

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2780"/>
outside; thinks

          <app from="pr2780" n="151.15 (477.8–9)" type="e" xml:id="la4535">
            <lem wit="A Cent">outside; thinks</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1b">outside. Thinks</rdg>
          </app>
I, what does it mean?

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2781"/>
Down

