        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e36353">“What’s it all about?”</p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e36355">
Says

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2785"/>
he—

          <app from="pr2785" n="151.18 (477.15)" type="hc" xml:id="la4541">
            <lem wit="MS1b">he—</lem>
            <rdg wit="A Cent">he:</rdg>
          </app>
        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e36364">
“Don’t you know,

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2786"/>
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg1572"/>
mars

          <ptr target="#l11144" type="alt" xml:id="te1572"/>
          <app from="pr2786" n="151.19 (477.17)" type="e" xml:id="la4542">
            <lem wit="C">mars</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1b A Cent">Mars</rdg>
          </app>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2787"/>
Jawge

