            <lem wit="A Cent">Jawge</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1b">George</rdg>
          </app>
?”

        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e36383">“No,” says I, “I don’t.”</p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e36385">
“Well, den, Miss Sophia’s run off!

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2788"/>
’Deed

