            <rdg wit="MS1b">off up</rdg>
          </app>
de river road for to try to ketch dat young man

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg1583"/>
en kill

          <ptr target="#l11166" type="alt" xml:id="te1583"/>
him ’fo’ he kin git acrost de river wid Miss Sophia. I

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2802"/>
reck’n

          <app from="pr2802" n="151.29 (479.12)" type="e" xml:id="la4558">
            <lem wit="A Cent">reck’n</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS1b">reckon</rdg>
          </app>
dey’s

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr2803"/>
gwyne

          <app from="pr2803" n="151.30 (479.12)" type="hc" xml:id="la4559">
            <lem wit="MS1b,A">gwyne</lem>
            <rdg wit="Cent">gwine</rdg>
          </app>
to be mighty rough times.”

        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e36561">“Buck went off ’thout waking me up.”</p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e36563">
