[¶] Well

            </rdg>
            <rdg wit="Cent">[¶] Well</rdg>
          </app>
        </p>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e48131">
          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg1921"/>
Well, that

          <ptr target="#l11622" type="alt" xml:id="te1921"/>
night we had

          <hi rend="italic">our</hi>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3843"/>
show,

          <app from="pr3843" n="194.20 (182.5)" type="hc" xml:id="la5706">
            <lem wit="MS2">show,</lem>
            <rdg wit="A Cent">show;</rdg>
          </app>
but there

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg1922"/>
warn’t

          <ptr target="#l11623" type="alt" xml:id="te1922"/>
only about twelve people

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3844"/>
there;

          <app from="pr3844" n="194.21 (182.7)" type="hc" xml:id="la5707">
            <lem wit="MS2,A">there;</lem>
            <rdg wit="Cent">there;—</rdg>
          </app>
just enough

          <anchor type="alt" xml:id="tg1923"/>
to pay

          <ptr target="#l11624" type="alt" xml:id="te1923"/>
expenses. And they laughed all the time,

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3845"/>
and that

          <app from="pr3845" n="194.22 (182.9)" type="e" xml:id="la5708">
            <lem wit="A Cent">and that</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS2">which</rdg>
          </app>
made the duke mad; and everybody left,

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3846"/>
anyway

          <app from="pr3846" n="194.23 (182.10–11)" type="e" xml:id="la5709">
            <lem wit="A Cent">anyway</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS2">
any-

              <lb/>
way

            </rdg>
          </app>
, before the show was over, but one

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3847"/>
boy which

          <app from="pr3847" n="194.23 (182.12)" type="e" xml:id="la5710">
            <lem wit="A Cent">boy which</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS2">boy, and he</rdg>
          </app>
was asleep. So the duke said these

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3848"/>
Arkansaw

          <app from="pr3848" n="194.24 (182.13–14)" type="e" xml:id="la5711">
            <lem wit="A Cent">Arkansaw</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS2">Arkansas</rdg>
          </app>
lunkheads couldn’t

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3849"/>
come up to

          <app from="pr3849" n="194.24 (182.15)" type="e" xml:id="la5712">
            <lem wit="A Cent">come up to</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS2">appreciate</rdg>
          </app>
          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3850"/>
Shakspeare:

          <app from="pr3850" n="194.25 (182.15)" type="hc" xml:id="la5713">
            <lem wit="MS2">Shakspeare:</lem>
            <rdg wit="A">Shakspeare;</rdg>
            <rdg wit="Cent">Shakspere;</rdg>
          </app>
what they wanted was low comedy—and

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3851"/>
maybe

          <app from="pr3851" n="194.25 (183.2)" type="hc" xml:id="la5714">
            <lem wit="MS2">maybe</lem>
            <rdg wit="A Cent">may be</rdg>
          </app>
something

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3852"/>
ruther

          <app from="pr3852" n="194.26 (183.3)" type="e" xml:id="la5715">
            <lem wit="A Cent">ruther</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS2">still</rdg>
          </app>
worse than low comedy, he reckoned. He

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="kg0064"/>
said

          <app from="kg0064" n="194.26 (183.4–5)" type="e" xml:id="kf0064">
            <lem wit="A Cent">said</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS2">said he judged</rdg>
          </app>
he

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3854"/>
could

          <app from="pr3854" n="194.26 (183.5–7)" type="e" xml:id="la5717">
            <lem wit="A Cent">could</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS2">could caper to their base instincts; ’lowed he could</rdg>
          </app>
size their style. So next morning he got some big sheets of

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3855"/>
wrapping paper

          <app from="pr3855" n="194.27–28 (183.9)" type="hc" xml:id="la5718">
            <lem wit="MS2">wrapping paper</lem>
            <rdg wit="A Cent">wrapping-paper</rdg>
          </app>
and some black paint, and drawed off some

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr3856"/>
handbills

          <app from="pr3856" n="194.28 (183.11)" type="hc" xml:id="la5719">
            <lem wit="MS2,A">handbills</lem>
            <rdg wit="Cent">hand-bills</rdg>
          </app>
and stuck them up all over the village. The bills

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="kg0068"/>
said:

          <app from="kg0068" n="194.29 (183.13)" type="e" xml:id="kf0068">
            <lem wit="Cent">
said:

              <note place="inline" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="uma006">extra line space</note>
            </lem>
            <rdg wit="MS2 A">
said:

              <note place="inline" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="uma007">no extra line space</note>
            </rdg>
          </app>
        </p>
