              </rdg>
            </app>
          </l>
        </quote>
        <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e48467">
“There,” says he, “if that line don’t fetch them, I

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="kg0082"/>
don’t know

          <app from="kg0082" n="195.8 (185.2)" type="hc" xml:id="kf0082">
            <lem wit="MS2">don’t know</lem>
            <rdg wit="A">dont know</rdg>
