            <lem wit="A Cent">in with all their might</lem>
            <rdg wit="MS2">
in, a-

              <lb/>
booming

            </rdg>
          </app>
, and it just warmed you up and made you feel as good as church letting out. Music

          <hi rend="italic">is</hi>
a good thing; and after all that

          <anchor type="app" xml:id="pr4188"/>
soul-butter and

          <anchor type="an" xml:id="pt0003"/>
hogwash

          <app from="pr4188" n="213.14–15 (243.8)" type="e" xml:id="la6102">
