            <milestone rend="lightparallel" unit="section"/>
            <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e88775">
              <add>
                <hi rend="bold">scrub race</hi>
              </add>
            </p>
            <p rend="noindent" xml:id="d1e88779">
L. A. punished her child several days for

              <del>disobedience</del>
              <add>refusing to answer?</add>
& inattention (5 yr old) then while punishing discovered it was deaf

              <del>& dumb</del>
& dumb! (from scarlet fever).

              <del>T</del>
It showed no reproachfulness for the whippings—kissed the punisher & showed non-comprehension of what it was all about.

            </p>
