            <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e89101">But they hived a nigger that stole a hog.</p>
            <p rend="noindent" xml:id="d1e89103">
Let Huck miss Jim—king & duke have sold him.

              <note n="1" place="foot" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="fa0044">See chapter 31 (266.36–268.11).</note>
            </p>
            <!-- </graphicGroup> -->
