          <div3 type="wknt" xml:id="la0682">
            <head>C-5</head>
            <lb/>
            <p rend="center" xml:id="d1e94442">1</p>
            <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e94444">
              <del>I wish to read</del>
            </p>
            <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e94447">
This is

              <del>part of</del>
a chapter from an unpublished story of mine called the Adventures of Huckleberry Finn—

              <add>
the episode is a

                <add>sort of</add>
story in itself—

              </add>
& I will divide it & make 2 separate readings of it.

            </p>
            <p rend="text-indent:2" xml:id="d1e94458">
Jim, a runaway slave from Missouri,—he is an old friend of Huck Finn & Tom Sawyer,

              <add>—</add>
is captured, far down the Mississippi, &

              <add>by chance is</add>
imprisoned in an isolated log cabin on a small plantation belonging to Tom’s uncle,—& Tom is

              <del>visiting</del>
there on a visit.

              <add>When this episode begins,</add>
Tom & Huck have been secretly at work, 2 or 3 weeks,

              <del>now,</del>
to set Jim free.

            </p>
          </div3>
