They could

              <add>get him out &</add>
turn

              <note n="1" place="foot" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="fqr088">Written over about three unrecovered characters.</note>
him loose

              <hi rend="italic">any</hi>
night, without

              <hi rend="italic">any</hi>
trouble, for no watch is kept; but Tom has read all the remarkable prison-escapes

            </p>
            <p rend="center" xml:id="d1e94497">
              <note place="inline" resp="MTP" type="ed" xml:id="de0684">page 3 of Mark Twain’s notes does not survive</note>
            </p>
