                <hi rend="italic">Times</hi>
, 11 January 1885, 13.

              </p>
              <p rend="noindent" xml:id="d1e105256">
“Two Tramps: The King and the Duke Afloat and Ashore,” Boston

                <hi rend="italic">Herald</hi>
, 11 January 1885, 13.

              </p>
              <p rend="noindent" xml:id="d1e105261">
